    <briefdescription>
<para>Parsed OCI image reference. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An OCI reference has the form: [registry/][namespace/]name[:tag][@digest]</para>
<para>Examples:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&quot;ghcr.io/themisdb/plugins/s3_blob:1.2.0&quot;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&quot;registry.example.com/myplugin@sha256:abc123...&quot; </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
